WEBVTT

00:00.850 --> 00:03.440
Inspiration

00:01.270 --> 00:04.270
Futarikiri paradise

00:01.270 --> 00:04.270
<i>A paradise all to ourselves...</i>

00:04.270 --> 00:06.020
I love you

00:04.270 --> 00:06.020
<i>I love you!</i>

00:06.020 --> 00:10.370
<i>I love you, summer days!</i>

00:10.370 --> 00:14.700
<i>I've been waiting for this kiss,</i>

00:14.700 --> 00:17.170
<i>and I start to run.</i>

00:17.170 --> 00:21.620
<i>Summer-colored memories!</i>

00:25.620 --> 00:27.990
Thanks, everyone!

00:30.710 --> 00:37.640
And that was the 1-B presentation,
a Sonokoe Utae special hot springs concert!

00:37.640 --> 00:41.080
Let's see what the judges thought!

00:38.720 --> 00:42.730
Inspiration Festival Ground

00:46.230 --> 00:50.000
Right now, 1-2 is in the lead with all the points!

00:51.820 --> 00:54.610
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:03.160 --> 01:08.210
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:08.210 --> 01:13.800
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:14.630 --> 01:19.350
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:19.350 --> 01:25.020
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:25.560 --> 01:28.480
Your voice will escape daringly!

01:28.480 --> 01:31.360
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

01:31.360 --> 01:34.280
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

01:34.280 --> 01:36.280
These wild ideas have all detonated!

01:36.280 --> 01:39.120
I want to try and swallow more

01:39.120 --> 01:42.290
I want you to pet me more

01:42.290 --> 01:45.120
What kind of flavor is your heart?

01:45.120 --> 01:48.000
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

01:48.000 --> 01:50.290
I want to embrace you more

01:50.290 --> 01:53.500
Will you secretly let me see you?

01:53.550 --> 01:56.380
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

01:56.380 --> 02:01.760
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

01:59.590 --> 02:04.350
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:05.220 --> 02:10.520
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:22.330 --> 02:26.700
"Steamy Town Elegy"

02:22.990 --> 02:25.820
To understand what's happening at Inspiration Academy,

02:25.820 --> 02:28.290
we go back one week.

02:43.160 --> 02:44.390
This is the best!

02:45.010 --> 02:47.680
I feel so relaxed...

02:47.680 --> 02:50.390
It's hard to believe we're at school.

02:51.500 --> 02:54.900
Yes. We're on Inspiration Academy grounds.

02:55.150 --> 02:56.730
Genius Inn
Manager

02:55.270 --> 02:59.910
The geniuses who found a hot spring
on campus came together,

02:56.440 --> 02:58.110
Genius
Dowser

02:57.650 --> 02:59.400
Genius
Digger

02:58.900 --> 03:00.400
Genius Hot
Springs
Manager

02:59.910 --> 03:03.410
to build a gigantic town
centered on the hot springs.

03:03.410 --> 03:05.380
This feels great.

03:05.380 --> 03:08.810
I wish there were more places like this...

03:08.810 --> 03:11.170
Leave that to me.

03:14.170 --> 03:16.180
I'll excavate a bunch more!

03:15.330 --> 03:16.630
Good luck!

03:16.170 --> 03:18.300
Let's start over there.

03:18.300 --> 03:19.530
Hey!

03:19.530 --> 03:21.510
Are you trying to dig a hole in the bathtub?

03:21.510 --> 03:24.720
You can't just randomly dig,
expecting to find a hot spring!

03:24.720 --> 03:25.810
You can't?

03:26.360 --> 03:28.210
Ill-omened...

03:30.230 --> 03:31.310
I can't see...

03:31.310 --> 03:33.260
This is disgusting, Taketo!

03:33.260 --> 03:35.310
I guess everyone does it.

03:35.310 --> 03:38.230
If you want so much to see
someone naked, I'll...

03:38.240 --> 03:39.740
If you want to see, stop hiding and look!

03:42.760 --> 03:44.370
Taketo-kun...

03:44.370 --> 03:47.070
U-Utae-san... I, well...

03:47.070 --> 03:49.160
You've got guts, breaking into the girls' bath!

03:49.160 --> 03:51.700
Are you following your
overwhelming passion? How ugly!

03:51.700 --> 03:52.870
No!

03:52.870 --> 03:55.520
Someone just knocked us into the wall!

03:55.520 --> 03:56.920
Who might that be?

03:56.920 --> 03:57.830
Me!

04:02.700 --> 04:04.050
10/10!

04:04.340 --> 04:06.300
Tetsubou Meguru

04:04.590 --> 04:06.100
Genius

04:04.590 --> 04:06.050
Gymnast!!

04:05.810 --> 04:07.760
First years...

04:07.760 --> 04:10.250
Haven't you been slacking off a bit lately?

04:10.250 --> 04:11.560
Botan-senpai?

04:11.560 --> 04:16.100
Did you attend this school just to
screw around at a hot spring?

04:16.100 --> 04:17.400
Losers.

04:17.400 --> 04:20.300
You think you can come here
and boss us around?

04:20.300 --> 04:23.530
The only one who's screwed-up and
screwing around is Taketo!

04:23.530 --> 04:25.320
You're blaming this on me?

04:25.320 --> 04:27.740
You really are loafing about.

04:27.740 --> 04:30.320
You're worthless... A waste of genius.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.580
Are we really that bad?

04:31.580 --> 04:33.910
As upperclassmen, we can't ignore this.

04:33.910 --> 04:35.830
We need to teach you a lesson.

04:36.660 --> 04:41.590
We'll administer a test, to see if you're
truly worthy of Inspiration Academy.

04:41.590 --> 04:43.340
A test? What kind of test?

04:43.340 --> 04:47.720
We're holding an orientation tournament
for all the first-year classes!

04:48.850 --> 04:50.350
A tournament for all the classes?

04:50.350 --> 04:53.830
The Inspiration Hot Springs Town
will host the first round.

04:53.830 --> 04:56.350
Giving us an event that only
a genius could create.

04:56.350 --> 04:59.020
The second and third year
students will judge you.

04:59.020 --> 05:01.090
And the number one class...

05:01.090 --> 05:02.110
...wins!

05:07.690 --> 05:08.980
Taketo-kun...

05:12.410 --> 05:14.870
Inspiration Hot

05:12.790 --> 05:14.870
Springs Town

05:16.830 --> 05:19.000
This place is completely deserted...

05:19.000 --> 05:21.590
I just can't believe people don't
see how great this is!

05:21.590 --> 05:36.480
Mathematics                Fortune Telling

05:22.450 --> 05:24.790
Mathematics Fortune Telling is kinda lame.

05:24.790 --> 05:26.530
How rude!

05:26.530 --> 05:29.090
It's a revolutionary type of fortune telling,

05:29.090 --> 05:32.120
based on my theory of the similarities between naughty milk bottles and lone left socks,

05:32.120 --> 05:35.090
all combined with the theory of relativity.

05:35.090 --> 05:36.480
I don't understand any of that!

05:36.480 --> 05:38.100
We're done for...

05:38.100 --> 05:41.110
A concert by the world's most popular idol...
Completely unfair!

05:42.340 --> 05:44.550
I thought outdoor shops,
in a hot springs town,

05:44.550 --> 05:47.660
are such fixtures, they'd have to be popular.

05:45.110 --> 05:46.400
Bug Battle Arena

05:46.400 --> 05:47.660
Habanero Drinks

05:47.660 --> 05:48.910
Cutting
Cabbage

05:47.660 --> 05:48.910
Ten
Straight
Hours!

05:49.760 --> 05:55.020
It sucks, but I guess no one
can match Utae-san's charms...

05:55.020 --> 05:58.030
Ah, except Narukara-san!

05:58.030 --> 05:59.420
And the rest of us can't?

05:59.420 --> 06:02.020
We just have to win from here on.

06:02.020 --> 06:03.860
Let's both do our best, okay?

06:04.680 --> 06:07.930
I have to hold a concert...

06:07.930 --> 06:09.360
A concert?

06:09.360 --> 06:12.150
That's right! We could do that!

06:12.150 --> 06:16.820
If they're having a concert, then we should
have Fukune-chan hold one, too!

06:17.940 --> 06:20.110
I see. An eye for an eye, huh?

06:20.110 --> 06:23.440
I have a solo concert at the National Music Hall!

06:24.530 --> 06:26.260
Th-The National...

06:26.260 --> 06:27.440
A concert?

06:27.440 --> 06:28.690
That's amazing!

06:28.690 --> 06:33.060
Only people who are recognized
as the best play there.

06:33.060 --> 06:35.450
A stage for the chosen ones only, right?

06:35.450 --> 06:38.810
That's only natural. Your music's the best!

06:39.560 --> 06:41.470
I wanted to refuse, but...

06:41.970 --> 06:44.990
It's fine. If that's how it is, then it's okay.

06:44.990 --> 06:46.860
That's right! Good luck, Narukara.

06:46.860 --> 06:47.970
U-Um...

06:47.970 --> 06:50.050
Don't worry. We'll be all right.

06:50.050 --> 06:52.440
Taketo will think of some way around this.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.620
I will?!

06:53.620 --> 06:56.720
You do want to let Fukune-chan
focus on her performance, right?

06:56.720 --> 06:58.000
Don't mess it up!

06:58.780 --> 07:00.760
I wanted to go and cheer her on...

07:01.730 --> 07:07.270
I'm sorry I can't go. But let everyone else
hear your wonderful music, okay?

07:07.990 --> 07:09.180
Good luck.

07:24.290 --> 07:29.690
Class 1-A tried an all-male, BL play.

07:24.290 --> 07:29.670
Romeo-kun and Juliet-kun

07:29.690 --> 07:33.800
But it was only popular with a
small set of devoted female fans.

07:33.800 --> 07:36.900
Without the score they hoped for,
they ended up losing.

07:33.800 --> 07:38.060
Inspiration

07:33.800 --> 07:38.060
Festival Ground

07:36.900 --> 07:42.060
Will class 3 be able to overtake
class 2's heavy lead?

07:43.530 --> 07:45.150
How pathetic...

07:45.150 --> 07:48.060
I'm surprised you call yourselves geniuses,
with that level of skill.

07:48.060 --> 07:49.400
You average people!

07:49.920 --> 07:53.370
If you don't like that, then show us your talent.

07:56.280 --> 08:01.030
It's gonna be hard to come back from this.

08:01.030 --> 08:06.460
But I told Narukara-san to do her best,
so I can't give up now...

08:06.460 --> 08:07.660
Taketo-kun...

08:08.170 --> 08:11.150
Utae-san? You're still wearing your outfit?

08:11.150 --> 08:14.220
I was told to keep wearing it
through the first round.

08:14.220 --> 08:16.540
Don't stare at me...

08:16.540 --> 08:17.950
I'm sorry!

08:17.950 --> 08:21.040
I guess class 2 relied on you for everything.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.060
That'll be hard to beat...

08:22.800 --> 08:25.520
I'm sorry. I feel like it's my fault.

08:25.520 --> 08:27.300
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

08:27.910 --> 08:30.370
I wasn't happy about how it would affect you.

08:30.370 --> 08:32.820
But the rest of the class insisted.

08:32.820 --> 08:35.100
It's a tournament, so it makes sense.

08:35.100 --> 08:38.730
I wish I were in your class, Taketo-kun.

08:38.730 --> 08:40.870
Oh, well. Come on and play!

08:40.870 --> 08:43.080
I bet you haven't netted goldfish in a long time!

08:43.940 --> 08:46.570
Yeah! I loved it when I was a kid.

08:46.570 --> 08:47.250
Here you go!

08:47.250 --> 08:48.340
Thanks!

08:48.870 --> 08:50.810
Which should I go for?

08:50.810 --> 08:53.740
I like the red ones, but the
pop-eyed ones are nice, too...

08:54.750 --> 08:57.090
Okay, I'll go for the pop-eyed ones!

08:58.720 --> 09:02.310
<i>Those bulges on her chest,
seen when I was young...</i>

09:02.310 --> 09:04.520
<i>The summer day we first recognized
each other as man and woman,</i>

09:04.520 --> 09:07.980
<i>beginning to climb the stairs to adulthood.</i>

09:08.940 --> 09:11.480
<i>And the boy became a man...</i>

09:11.480 --> 09:14.490
<i>He stood up, bold and strong!</i>

09:15.210 --> 09:17.990
That's pretty good!

09:17.990 --> 09:19.700
Pretty good...

09:19.700 --> 09:21.970
Um, well...

09:21.970 --> 09:23.880
Did you get an idea for a novel?

09:26.160 --> 09:27.580
Naughty.

09:36.640 --> 09:37.780
There's no sound.

09:38.840 --> 09:41.100
Good luck, good luck, Utae-san!

09:41.100 --> 09:43.560
Good luck, good luck, Utae-san!

09:43.560 --> 09:46.420
I was so close...

09:45.200 --> 09:46.420
Don't worry about it.

09:46.420 --> 09:47.900
Why are you playing around?

09:47.900 --> 09:50.560
You have an idea on how
we can get out of this, right?

09:50.560 --> 09:52.930
I can't just come up with something like that.

09:52.930 --> 09:55.070
So you went on a date with the enemy?

09:55.070 --> 09:56.580
You must think we're all idiots.

09:56.580 --> 09:59.510
Don't call her the enemy...
Utae-san is my friend!

10:00.870 --> 10:02.330
Friend?

10:02.330 --> 10:04.440
Just think of something, already.

10:04.440 --> 10:07.210
But Narukara-san isn't here.

10:07.210 --> 10:11.410
If she were, I bet I could
come up with something...

10:12.210 --> 10:14.160
Let me help.

10:14.160 --> 10:16.970
I'll do anything I can to help!

10:16.970 --> 10:19.470
You're from class 2, though.

10:20.220 --> 10:22.540
I-I am, but...

10:22.540 --> 10:25.640
I want to help Taketo-kun. Okay?

10:25.650 --> 10:28.530
The classes are competing. You can't do that.

10:28.530 --> 10:29.860
Yeah...

10:29.860 --> 10:31.730
I'm glad you'd want to help, but...

10:31.730 --> 10:33.730
I may be an idol, but I'm still a girl!

10:34.980 --> 10:37.780
I always have lots of fans who cheer me on.

10:37.780 --> 10:42.140
But as a girl, sometimes I'd like
to cheer someone on.

10:42.140 --> 10:43.720
Utae-san...

10:44.620 --> 10:45.630
Thank you!

10:46.380 --> 10:50.170
I'm so happy you said that!

11:04.180 --> 11:06.180
That's it!

11:14.200 --> 11:15.220
Yes?

11:17.130 --> 11:18.440
Dad?

11:38.380 --> 11:40.130
Girl Genius

11:38.380 --> 11:40.130
Narukara
Fukune

11:38.380 --> 11:40.130
Solo Concert

11:48.100 --> 11:50.750
Aim carefully!

11:50.750 --> 11:52.760
You're aiming for the pink nipples!

11:53.910 --> 11:55.110
I did it.

11:55.110 --> 11:57.380
He got the areola!

11:58.360 --> 12:00.940
Hey, Ran. The words...

12:00.940 --> 12:03.940
N-No... Not there!

12:03.940 --> 12:06.460
I'm sick of saying this stuff!

12:06.460 --> 12:08.420
You want the customers to leave?

12:08.420 --> 12:11.160
O-Oh, fine!

12:11.160 --> 12:15.670
Oh, you're such a pervert, aiming there!

12:17.410 --> 12:19.320
Let's keep at it!

12:19.320 --> 12:20.210
All right!

12:21.550 --> 12:23.180
Perfect shot! Strike!

12:24.310 --> 12:25.470
That's it!

12:25.470 --> 12:27.180
I love it when you touch me there!

12:27.180 --> 12:31.330
Now, if you think these are normal
water yo-yo's, you're in for a big surprise.

12:31.330 --> 12:33.050
Look carefully...

12:33.050 --> 12:35.440
There's a really ero-ero one in there.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.350
Yo-yo fishing, one of the
world's strangest hobbies!

12:39.350 --> 12:41.820
Don't screw up and hook the bikinis.

12:41.820 --> 12:45.480
Of course, everyone messes up sometimes...

12:46.110 --> 12:49.200
He was aiming for the bikini the whole time!

12:49.200 --> 12:51.700
No!  This bikini hooks in the front!

12:51.700 --> 12:54.720
Hey, the yo-yo's aren't allowed to run...

12:54.720 --> 12:56.260
Just lie there!

12:56.260 --> 12:57.880
Ugly.

12:57.880 --> 13:00.180
This is your strategy?

13:00.720 --> 13:02.790
Eros is humanity's most basic instinct.

13:02.790 --> 13:05.670
Aim toward it, and people will flock to you.

13:05.670 --> 13:08.470
I agree with you that people are basically ugly.

13:08.470 --> 13:10.800
No one can resist the lure of eros.

13:10.800 --> 13:13.060
We're sure to win now!

13:14.140 --> 13:15.520
Pink Butt Candy Apples

13:15.520 --> 13:17.270
Maybe I'll switch to class 3...

13:15.520 --> 13:17.270
Eros Chocolate
ABananas

13:17.270 --> 13:20.090
A guy would be happiest in class 3!

13:22.530 --> 13:24.770
Okay, that's it...

13:24.770 --> 13:26.780
Everyone's having a great time.

13:26.780 --> 13:28.440
I was surprised.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.980
Yeah, now it'll be a close match.

13:30.980 --> 13:32.790
I'm impressed, Taketo-kun.

13:35.790 --> 13:38.200
It's all thanks to you, Utae-san.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.540
Thank you so much!

13:45.250 --> 13:50.510
I'm excited, just knowing it's the musical genius, Master Narukara's daughter.

13:50.510 --> 13:53.240
I've heard it's like the sound of an angel.

14:07.690 --> 14:09.160
Daddy!

14:09.560 --> 14:11.600
<i>Music chooses you.</i>

14:12.570 --> 14:16.870
<i>Those whom the music chooses
are called "geniuses."</i>

14:20.580 --> 14:24.050
<i>I love your music!</i>

14:26.180 --> 14:28.470
My music...

14:29.250 --> 14:32.020
What is my music?

14:35.470 --> 14:36.980
Sonokoe Utae Autograph and Handshake Event

14:36.590 --> 14:38.730
Why aren't more people here?

14:38.730 --> 14:41.090
Looks like they're all over there, with class 3.

14:41.750 --> 14:44.930
I'm so humiliated, having all my customers
stolen by those filthy shops!

14:44.930 --> 14:46.400
It can't be helped.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.740
It's a competition.

14:47.740 --> 14:49.310
You're not upset?

14:49.310 --> 14:51.230
They're doing their best, too.

14:51.230 --> 14:54.190
It's more fun to have rivals.

14:54.190 --> 14:56.500
So that's how it works?

14:57.440 --> 14:59.070
<i>Except in love...</i>

15:06.990 --> 15:08.660
Good luck, good luck!

15:09.510 --> 15:11.640
Good luck! Aim well!

15:11.640 --> 15:13.790
Shoot well, and hear the very voice of Eros!

15:13.790 --> 15:16.540
So keep firing, to keep her talking!

15:17.140 --> 15:19.480
Thank you for your support!

15:19.480 --> 15:21.090
I love you, Utae-chan.

15:21.090 --> 15:22.480
Thank you.

15:24.980 --> 15:27.350
<i>It's all thanks to you, Utae-san.</i>

15:27.350 --> 15:28.940
<i>Thank you so much!</i>

15:30.020 --> 15:31.980
Good luck, Utae-chan!

15:31.980 --> 15:33.070
Thank you...

15:47.580 --> 15:52.340
And the first round of the orientation
tournament came to a close.

15:53.250 --> 15:54.680
Damn it! We were so close...

15:54.680 --> 15:56.670
We almost won...

15:56.670 --> 15:59.430
It's unfortunate, but we did our best.

16:01.940 --> 16:03.930
The winner of round one

16:03.930 --> 16:05.190
is class 1-2!

16:05.800 --> 16:07.850
We were really surprised by class 3.

16:07.850 --> 16:10.310
I was impressed that you managed
to mount such a comeback.

16:10.310 --> 16:12.700
It was a pretty interesting match...

16:12.700 --> 16:15.380
But we're just getting started.

16:15.380 --> 16:17.050
It's a three-round match!

16:16.950 --> 16:18.200
What?

16:18.200 --> 16:20.740
The second round measures who
raises the most money...

16:20.740 --> 16:23.210
And the third round is a chorus.

16:23.220 --> 16:25.490
Class 2 won this round, so they get 100 points.

16:25.490 --> 16:27.910
Class 3 came in second, so they get 50 points.

16:27.910 --> 16:29.960
Naturally, last place gains no points.

16:29.960 --> 16:34.470
The class with the most points,
at the end of all the matches, wins.

16:34.470 --> 16:38.090
And the triumphant class will win
an ultra luxurious vacation!

16:38.960 --> 16:42.170
You can go anywhere you want on Earth.

16:42.170 --> 16:44.720
Everyone, want to go on a trip?

16:45.980 --> 16:48.210
A final choral competition?

16:48.210 --> 16:51.350
Class 2 has Utae-chan, so they
maintain the advantage...

16:51.350 --> 16:52.770
That's not true.

16:52.770 --> 16:55.730
When Narukara-san returns,
we can ask her to accompany us.

16:55.730 --> 16:56.740
That's right!

16:56.740 --> 16:59.410
This time, we can do more
than simply match them!

17:06.610 --> 17:08.510
Taketo-kun, nice work today.

17:09.490 --> 17:11.640
Congratulations on your victory, Utae-san!

17:11.640 --> 17:12.790
It was close.

17:12.790 --> 17:15.010
You were amazing.

17:16.150 --> 17:18.240
I'm really tired now, though.

17:18.240 --> 17:20.840
I feel like spending some time in a hot spring.

17:20.840 --> 17:23.060
And where are we right now?

17:27.480 --> 17:29.560
This is wonderful...

17:32.980 --> 17:35.010
Utae-san!

17:35.010 --> 17:36.070
I came.

17:36.070 --> 17:38.100
Y-You came?

17:38.100 --> 17:39.740
No one was on the other side.

17:39.740 --> 17:42.950
I don't have many chances to visit a hot spring,
and I'd be lonely by myself...

17:43.680 --> 17:46.320
So, may I come in?

